      "passageHtml": "<div class=\"source-doc\"><section style=\"border:1px solid #aab0b4;padding:14px;margin-bottom:16px;background:#fff\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align:center\">Text-Message Chain</h3>\n<p style=\"background:#eef2f5;border-radius:12px;padding:10px\"><strong>Harry Matthews (11:19 A.M.)</strong><br>Hi Linhan. Did you already e-mail me the list of this week’s invoices?</p>\n<p style=\"background:#f3f6ed;border-radius:12px;padding:10px\"><strong>Linhan Xu (11:24 A.M.)</strong><br>Yes. I sent it over earlier today with the sales-calls records.</p>\n<p style=\"background:#eef2f5;border-radius:12px;padding:10px\"><strong>Harry Matthews (11:25 A.M.)</strong><br>Really? I hope I didn’t delete it. Did you accidentally send the e-mail to Harvey Mattson?</p>\n<p style=\"background:#f3f6ed;border-radius:12px;padding:10px\"><strong>Linhan Xu (11:28 A.M.)</strong><br>Oh, wait — it looks like I forgot to attach it! I’ll send it over now.</p>\n<p style=\"background:#eef2f5;border-radius:12px;padding:10px\"><strong>Harry Matthews (11:30 A.M.)</strong><br>Just got it. Thanks!</p></section></div>",
